  "name": "Sample",
  "description": "A neutral scene script: two characters (roles a and b) and an item held by a (role p). It uses every command form the converted scenes use, a track of every type, a move, a follow, a depth-of-field command, stains made in the preparation and ragdolls built and released. The last set-up step names accessory slots 17 and 18, which the test characters do not wear: it fails on purpose.",
